# ── com.chrisren.* — the SECOND family this repo owns (added 2026-07-29 after the reconciler's
# first live run declared only com.claude.*, hiding 6 LOADED, RUNNING jobs from every leg).
# All six are enabled-by-default (ABSENT from the override db — never disabled, which is a THIRD
# state distinct from an explicit `=> enabled` repair scar) and all six are currently loaded.
# FIVE OF THEM HAVE NO REPO SSOT and are one `rm` from unrecoverable — including
# com.chrisren.cc-reaper, row 4's LIVE reaper. `--plist-parity` now names them; capturing the
# plists themselves is the follow-on (stranded commits e360c309 / a0e11648 / 687c2fd6 already
# contain that capture and should be cherry-picked rather than rewritten).
# NOT in scope, deliberately: com.reso.* / gl.reso.* belong to another project, and
# adobe/google/razer/homebrew/git are third-party — this board must not answer for them.
com.chrisren.autonomy-sweep        | run    | 300  | auto | 5  | 18-fleet-activate.sh
com.chrisren.cc-reaper             | run    | 300  | auto | 4  | 18-fleet-activate.sh
com.chrisren.restic-claude-archive | run    | 0    | auto | 12 | 18-fleet-activate.sh
